case "cosmetic purpose outranks a fully documented request -> Unmet":
- id is "cosmetic-outranks-documented-unmet".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "not-certify.Unmet".

case "PRECEDENCE DISCRIMINATOR - cosmetic purpose on a BOTH-procedure fully documented request -> Unmet. The cosmetic branch is hoisted ABOVE the both/one split; demote it and THIS goes red and nothing else does.":
- id is "cosmetic-both-procedures-unmet".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "not-certify.Unmet".

case "MULTI-ANSWER - a packet carrying BOTH a conforming photograph and a conforming visual field -> Met. These are two DIFFERENT coded questions, so they still co-occur after the migration.":
- id is "photograph-and-visual-field-both-submitted-met".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Demo VF 12 Degree".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "certify.Met".

case "OVERLAP ORACLE - photograph shows a listed finding but does NOT conform, while the visual field both conforms and demonstrates -> Met via the VF lane":
- id is "evidence-photo-half-vf-full-met".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Skin On Lashes".
- fact is "Demo VF 12 Degree".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Photographs Conform No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "certify.Met".

case "OVERLAP ORACLE (the separator) - photograph conforms but demonstrates nothing listed, while the visual field demonstrates but does not conform -> Unmet. Neither lane is complete; a flattened conjunction would wrongly pass this.":
- id is "evidence-crossed-lanes-unmet".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Demo VF 12 Degree".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "Photo Demo None".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "not-certify.Unmet".

case "RECORD ARM - no local attestation at all; a submitted ServiceRequest carrying CPT 15822 is what makes the request true -> Met":
- id is "request-via-record-arm-met".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested SR".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "certify.Met".

case "BOTH ARMS - a local attestation AND a matching submitted ServiceRequest, same code. The recency arbitration runs and both candidates yield the same answer -> Met":
- id is "request-both-arms-agree-met".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested SR".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "certify.Met".

case "DENY DISCRIMINATOR - a REAL ServiceRequest exists, fully documented, but its code is outside both covered sets -> Unmet. This is what the covered-service value sets are FOR, and it is distinct from requesting nothing at all: absence and non-membership both deny, and only this case proves the second one.":
- id is "non-covered-service-request-unmet".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Non-Covered Service Request".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented No".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested No".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested No".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "not-certify.Unmet".

case "RECORD ARM, both procedures - two submitted ServiceRequests, one per covered set, both individually documented -> Met":
- id is "both-procedures-via-record-arm-met".
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Requested SR".
- fact is "Blepharoptosis Repair Requested SR".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Blepharoplasty Documented".
- fact is "Ptosis Repair Documented".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
- fact is "Visual Field Conforms No".
- fact is "VF Demo None".
- result is "Blepharoplasty And Blepharoptosis Repair Coverage Determination" is "certify.Met".

